><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251014102431+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251014102433+10'00'" name="a136eeac-8470-4749-aeeb-1b52b73c8f72" page="5" coords="36.000000,195.923187,298.973999,195.923187,36.000000,184.893265,298.973999,184.893265,36.000000,184.925079,298.997925,184.925079,36.000000,173.895157,298.997925,173.895157,36.000000,173.926971,298.973083,173.926971,36.000000,162.897049,298.973083,162.897049,36.000000,162.928864,298.982941,162.928864,36.000000,151.898941,298.982941,151.898941,36.000000,151.930756,298.971893,151.930756,36.000000,140.900833,298.971893,140.900833,36.000000,140.932648,298.931641,140.932648,36.000000,129.902725,298.931641,129.902725,36.000000,129.877533,298.943970,129.877533,36.000000,118.847610,298.943970,118.847610,36.000000,118.879425,298.930267,118.879425,36.000000,107.849503,298.930267,107.849503,36.000000,107.881317,268.052704,107.881317,36.000000,96.851395,268.052704,96.851395" rect="35.655304,96.506699,299.342621,196.267883" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>High-level training and competitions are routinely scheduled and&#xD;held in challenging environmental conditions. The outcomes of the&#xD;current study contribute to a broader understanding of the GI and&#xD;thermophysiological responses that occur when well-trained individuals&#xD;exercise at increasing intensities in the heat. This information&#xD;may help to better shape an athlete’s approach to exercising&#xD;in challenging conditions. It appears that trained individuals are&#xD;largely tolerant to changes in GI permeability when performing&#xD;short bouts of running of increasing intensity in the heat.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="5" rect="612.000000,103.923187,796.000000,195.923187"
/></highlight
